# Canonical E2E harness storageState fixtures (issue #1713) — contain real
# session tokens (hosted Supabase Auth, per canonical-test.ts's
# canonicalStorageStatePath() seam for PR-3's authenticated specs) and must
# never be committed.
#
# NESTED here deliberately, not added to the root .gitignore: the root
# patterns `e2e/fixtures/*-auth.json` and `e2e-parity/fixtures/*-auth.json`
# are path-anchored (they contain a slash) and do NOT match
# e2e/canonical/fixtures/*-auth.json — a distinct directory. This file keeps
# the ignore rule next to the seam that creates the files, so it travels
# with the directory if it is ever moved, and needs no edit to the root
# .gitignore (out of scope for this slice).
fixtures/*-auth.json
